## ✅ Completed (v3.0.0 Development)

### Phase 7.4 Inc 1: Version Sync & Stale Cleanup (2026-03-05) — PR #11

- Synced all version strings to 3.0.0-beta.2 (pyproject.toml, package.json, __init__.py)
- Removed stale TUI dep, fixed Gemini SDK (google-generativeai → google-genai)
- Added anthropic optional dep, consolidated pytest config (deleted pytest.ini)
- Extended version consistency tests (+3 new tests)
- **Result**: 186/186 tests, all versions in sync

### Phase 7.3 Inc 1 & 2: JSON Export + Vault Health (2026-03-04) — PR #7, #8

- `--json` flag on all 10 data-outputting commands (early-return pattern)
- `obs health <vault>` command with 4 sub-scores (connectivity, integrity, structure, freshness)
- Rich progress bar dashboard + JSON output
- `HealthScore` and `VaultHealth` dataclasses in `core/models.py`
- `get_note_freshness()` in db_manager, `get_vault_health()` in vault_manager
- **Result**: 158/158 tests, 14 commands (+29 new tests)

### PR #5: Review Follow-ups (2026-03-04) — PR #5

- Wired `--verbose` flag to suggest-links, gaps, summarize commands
- Added verbose logging to ObsidianBridge (conditional stderr output)
- Narrowed `except Exception` to specific types (OSError, sqlite3.OperationalError, etc.)
- **Result**: 125/125 tests, all verbose paths tested

### Phase 7.2: AI Enhancement (2026-03-03) — PR #4

- Shared structured output models (`ai/models.py` — dataclasses with `from_json()`)
- Gemini SDK migration: `google-generativeai` → `google-genai` (native batch + structured output)
- Anthropic API provider: `anthropic_api.py` (claude-sonnet-4-6)
- Obsidian CLI bridge: `obsidian_bridge.py` (Null Object pattern, silent fallback)
- 3 new AI commands: `suggest-links`, `gaps`, `summarize` with embedding cache
- Embedding cache: SQLite `note_embeddings` table, mtime invalidation
- Retry with backoff: exponential backoff decorator on all API methods
- Legacy cleanup: deleted 5 files (ai_client*.py, setup_wizard.py, similarity_analyzer.py)
- Review fixes: narrowed exceptions, removed dead import, datetime.utcnow() → timezone-aware
- **Result**: 5 providers, 13 commands, net -92 lines

### Async & Vault Lookup Fix (2026-03-02) — PR #2

- Fixed async/await mismatch in scan_vault() with asyncio.run()
- Added 3-tier vault lookup (name → exact ID → prefix) in db_manager.py
- Extended to stats + analyze commands, ambiguous prefix feedback
- Updated 20+ docs: `<vault_id>` → `<vault>`
- **Result**: 42/42 tests, vault commands work by name or ID

### Phase 7.1: Simplification (2025-12-20) — PR #3

- Deleted TUI (1,701 lines), R-Dev integration (307 lines), legacy commands (126 lines)
- Consolidated 20+ commands → 10 focused commands
- Created MIGRATION.md (456 lines)
- Released v3.0.0-beta via CI pipeline (4 fix cycles)
- **Result**: 2,331 lines removed, ~7,400 lines remaining

### v3.0.0 Strategic Refocus (2025-12-20)

- Selected Proposal A: Pure Obsidian Knowledge Manager
- Eliminated overlap with zsh-configuration and aiterm
- Laser focus on vault management + AI-powered graph analysis
- Created 4 comprehensive proposals (~24,000 words)

